9hWjazYn7bQmJvCWEhjYJh", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53567, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019hWjazYn7bQmJvCWEhjYJh", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55035, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MSQ7vSP8cuirBGc3BCVdQG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55335, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MSQ7vSP8cuirBGc3BCVdQG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55335, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MSQ7vSP8cuirBGc3BCVdQG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 59430, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident (INC-0001).\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. I skipped v2.3.1-rc because it was also unhealthy. v2.3.0 has been healthy in production before, so this didn't need change-manager approval.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error. That left us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1. A second attempt finished the job.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now. The error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created. There's only one incident, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident says what was failing, what I rolled back, and that the rollout was interrupted. It lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the problem in v2.3.1, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollout.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01168xpRfFQaQyH8amHEtUno", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01R2Ddr9e4YeNrmtzCawTGsb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both unhealthy). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Cx71cyEq6ENaZMbcXCjpYd", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019g6Rwqi2pY3kyMfFffLqpX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Partial rollback: only us-east is on v2.3.0. Retrying the rollback once to cover the remaining regions.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MpHcc8U9WZcxYqNxd49hbD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01K5WaaTqbRC7JM4R3vNZMLf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01L5jf9Jqn