rror rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident:**\n- The request to create INC-0001 timed out. I checked the incident list before trying again and found it had been created. There's only one incident, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n- The incident says what was failing, what I rolled back, and that the rollout was interrupted. It lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the problem in v2.3.1, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the rollout.", "type": "text"}]}]}